## Build context exclusions.
##
## The signing key matters most here. demo.eudiw.grnet.gr_5603.key and
## snf-74864.ok-kno.grnetcloud.net.key are committed on the `demo` branch, and
## anyone building from that branch would otherwise bake them into a layer of a
## published image. Mounted at runtime instead.

.git
.gitignore
.github

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.venv
venv

# Key material and certificates, mounted at runtime, never baked in.
*.key
*.pem
*.der
*.crt
*.csr
*.p12
*.jwk.json
*.jwk.pub.json

# Runtime data. Lives in a volume; a copy in the image would shadow the mount
# and look like data loss.
status_lists/
status_list_backup/

# Host-specific / local noise
install.sh
run-statuslist-server.sh
.config.ip
.config.hostname
*.md
.env
.DS_Store
*~
